{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11206260","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11206260","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1120626001:0":{"text":"This is where you're supposed to meet your friends, right, Chezzig? Where are they?","source_cn":"切西格，你说的汇合地就是这里吧，你的朋友呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE1385066A3B739E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120626002:0":{"text":"My friends? Ha! They're already here.","source_cn":"我的朋友？已经来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x296062A636F567C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120626003:0":{"text":"You, my treasure-seeking friends, are gonna make me filthy rich! Thanks for coming all this way with me!","source_cn":"你们——我宝贵的朋友，金子铸成的风向标！感谢你们愿意来这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37E284E7314E257C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120626004:1":{"text":"What are you talking about...?","source_cn":"什么什么……你说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FE2BEF5D9A3458A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1120626004":{"text":"What are you talking about...?","source_cn":"什么什么……你说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FE2BEF5D9A3458A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120626005:1":{"text":"What?!","source_cn":"……啊？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7C7ED0BE994F0B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120626006:0":{"text":"You're a lot slower than your friend here, aren't you, Evan?","source_cn":"艾文，你的反应可比旁边这位朋友迟钝多了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x445159080202FDE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120626007:0":{"text":"For someone as slow-witted as you to defeat Puba and the others... I really don't know how you did it.","source_cn":"就凭你这后知后觉的反应……真不知道你们是怎么干掉蒲巴他们的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BBB5AA0222E02C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120626008:0":{"text":"It took a lot of effort to drag you halfwits out here, so don't think you're gonna escape.","source_cn":"我费了这么大力气，总算把你们带到这里了。这次你们别想跑了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6418D115C5F57EFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120626009:0":{"text":"You're with the bandits who attacked us before...?","source_cn":"你和之前抢劫我们的匪徒……是一伙的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB65B258F84BA91A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120626010:1":{"text":"I knew it! You're their leader, aren't you?!","source_cn":"果然，你才是那些盗匪的首领！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D01813E2E2806AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120626011:0":{"text":"That's right, now tell me where to find the treasure! You put me in a good mood after telling me about this twenty ironjaw load of treasure, so I might just spare your lives if you cooperate...","source_cn":"宝藏在哪儿？等我拿到“二十只钢颚兽才能驮动的宝藏”，心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x976B54150C434AF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120626012:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120626013:0":{"text":"Not willing to talk? Or do you still think you can get away? Ha! With our numbers, you're done for!","source_cn":"不说话？打逃跑的主意？哈哈哈，我们的人很多，你们是跑不掉的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF11688C6A50BA313","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120626014:0":{"text":"Get 'em!","